'''Redstone Dust''' is a {{Common}} [[Collection]] item in the {{skill|Mining}} category. It can be obtained by mining {{Item|Redstone Ore}} in the {{Zone|Pigman's Den}}, {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting {{Item|Redstone Dust}} increases the player's {{Coll|Redstone Dust}} [[Collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of Redstone Dust.

{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Redstone Dust}}

== Obtaining ==

=== Natural Generation ===
[[File:Redstone_ore.png|thumb]]
'''Redstone Ore''' spawns naturally in the {{Zone|Pigmen's Den}}, where it can be mined and collected by the player. Normally, it drops a number of Redstone pieces and grants +7 {{Skl|Mining}} XP. However, mining it this way attracts {{MobSprite|Redstone Pigman;Redstone Pigmen}} to attack to player, making it inconvenient to collect for early game player. The player can collect the {{Item|Redstone Ore}} directly with a {{ench|Silk Touch}} pickaxe, then bring it back to their island to mine afterwards. Although this does not grant mining XP, {{MobSprite|Redstone Pigman}} do not appear to be aggravated at players who mine {{Item|Redstone Ore}} in this way, and it also saves valuable inventory space. {{MobSprite|Redstone Pigman}} will only attack the player if they have at least 1 stack of Redstone Dust in their inventory; mining with a [[Mining Sack]] with more than 64 Redstone Dust will not attract the attention of {{MobSprite|Redstone Pigman;Redstone Pigmen}}. Redstone can also be safely collected via mining the Redstone, then crafting it into a {{Item|Block of Redstone}} before having more than 1 stack.

In the [[Dwarven Mines]], small amounts of {{Item|Redstone Ore}} may be mined from decorative parts of the map, such as the carts in {{Zone|Rampart's Quarry}}, though a more efficient way of getting Redstone are the several veins of [[Ores|Pure Redstone]], which are located in the {{Zone|Royal Mines}}.

In the [[Crystal Hollows]], {{Item|Redstone Ore}} may be found throughout the map. [[Ores|Pure Redstone]] can be found in the {{Zone|Mines of Divan}}, though less than in the {{Zone|Royal Mines}}.

