== Trivia ==
*While '''Redstone Dust''' may be seen as the hardest collection to max, seeing as to do so 1.4 million Redstone Dust needs to be collected, it is actually significantly easier than it may appear, due to the fact that each block-breaking action of a {{Item|Redstone Minion}} collects up to 5 Redstone.
*With 16 tiers, '''Redstone''' has highest amount of tiers in a single collection with the {{coll|Iron Ingot|img=y}}, {{coll|Nether Wart|img=y}} and {{coll|Magmafish|img=y}} collections tying for second place with 12 tiers. -->

